Built a comprehensive financial tracking application with **JWT authentication** for secure access to India and Canada investments.

**Core Features Implemented:**
- **JWT Authentication** - Secure email/password registration and login with token-based auth
- **Bank Accounts** - Track multiple accounts across INR, CAD, USD currencies
- **Stocks** - Real-time price tracking via Google Finance scraping
- **Mutual Funds** - NAV tracking and portfolio management
- **Fixed Deposits** - Automatic maturity amount calculations
- **Transactions** - Complete transaction history with categories
- **Dashboard** - Multi-currency portfolio overview with country breakdowns (India/Canada)

**Security & Data:**
- Password hashing with bcrypt
- JWT tokens with 7-day expiration
- User-specific data isolation (users only see their own data)
- Protected routes requiring authentication
- Secure logout functionality

**Technical Stack:**
- Backend: FastAPI with JWT, MongoDB, Google Finance scraping, Alpha Vantage integration
- Frontend: React with Auth Context, beautiful glassmorphism UI, responsive design
- Design: Modern teal/gold theme with Space Grotesk & Inter fonts

**Test Results:** 96% success (24/26 backend tests passed, 100% frontend flows working)

**Optional:** Add `ALPHA_VANTAGE_KEY` to `/app/backend/.env` for currency exchange rates feature.
